        add("Bearing painted wings. Will fly forward when this effect expires.", "Lleva alas pintadas. Volará hacia adelante al terminar este efecto.");
        add("Bodily aether has become unbalanced by the influence of warm hues. Will take severe damage if hit by another Warm Bomb.", "El aether corporal se desequilibró por la influencia de tonos cálidos. Otra Warm Bomb causará daño severo.");
        add("Bodily aether has become unbalanced by the influence of cool hues. Will take severe damage if hit by another Cool Bomb.", "El aether corporal se desequilibró por la influencia de tonos fríos. Otra Cool Bomb causará daño severo.");
        add("Covered in mousse and unable to move. Will detonate when this effect expires.", "La mousse cubre el cuerpo e impide moverse. Detonará al terminar este efecto.");
